            "title": "Example: Braces",
            "id": 74527,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Marque o código que pertence a essas funções.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"increaseBrightness\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Brightness up&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"decreaseBrightness\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Brightness down&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"increaseBrightness();\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"30\" endIndex=\"31\" /><option startIndex=\"63\" endIndex=\"64\" /><option startIndex=\"96\" endIndex=\"97\" /><option startIndex=\"131\" endIndex=\"132\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"function\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Brightness up\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>{</code> seguido de <code>}</code> e depois <code>{</code>, <code>}</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Complete as definições das funções para que a chamada fornecida exiba <code>Brightness up</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"increaseBrightness\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Brightness up&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"decreaseBrightness\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Brightness down&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"increaseBrightness();\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"30\" endIndex=\"31\" /><option startIndex=\"63\" endIndex=\"64\" /><option startIndex=\"96\" endIndex=\"97\" /><option startIndex=\"131\" endIndex=\"132\" /><option startIndex=\"9\" endIndex=\"27\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"decreaseBrightness\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"(\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\")\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Brightness up\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>increaseBrightness</code> seguido de <code>{</code>, <code>}</code>, <code>{</code> e finalmente <code>}</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Function",
            "id": 74492,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Por que criamos funções?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Agrupar e reutilizar código relacionado</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Para separar código relacionado</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Para facilitar a criação de variáveis</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Agrupar e reutilizar código relacionado.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Três botões devem mostrar a mesma mensagem de confirmação. Por que é melhor colocar essa mensagem em uma função?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">O código pode ser agrupado uma vez e chamado sempre que necessário.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Definir a função faz a mensagem aparecer automaticamente.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Cada botão recebe uma cópia separada do código da mensagem.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">O código pode ser agrupado uma vez e chamado sempre que necessário.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Calling the function",
            "id": 74488,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>O que acontece quando chamamos uma função?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">O código dentro da função é executado</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Todo o código dentro da função é armazenado em uma variável</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Um loop while é criado dentro da função</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">O código dentro da função é executado.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>showMenu</code> contém três instruções <code>console.log</code>. O que acontece quando o programa executa <code>showMenu()</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">As três instruções são executadas nesse ponto do programa.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">As instruções são armazenadas em uma nova variável.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">O JavaScript cria um loop ao redor das instruções.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">As três instruções são executadas nesse ponto do programa.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Calling the function",
            "id": 74483,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Conclua chamando a função codificando seu nome.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"displayCash\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" money = \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" currency = \" /><text value=\"&quot; Euros&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(money + currency);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"displayCash();\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"107\" endIndex=\"118\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"100 Euros\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>displayCash</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Braces",
            "id": 74532,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>O que este código exibe no console?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"daysAYear\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"365\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"daysAYear();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Days a year&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"365\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Days a year\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>365</code> em uma linha e <code>Dias por ano</code> na próxima</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>365</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>Days a year</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>365</code> em uma linha e <code>Dias por ano</code> na próxima.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quando <code>daysAYear()</code> é executada antes da instrução seguinte, qual valor chega primeiro ao console?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"daysAYear\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"365\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"daysAYear();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Days a year&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"365\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Days a year\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>365</code>, pois <code>daysAYear()</code> é executada antes da próxima instrução.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>Days a year</code>, pois está fora da função.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Os dois valores aparecem na mesma linha.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>365</code>, pois <code>daysAYear()</code> é executada antes da próxima instrução.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Pass parameters",
            "id": 74639,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Qual é o parâmetro nesta função?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"addUser\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"user\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" text = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Added: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(text + user);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>user</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>text</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Não há parâmetro</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>user</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Se o programa chamar <code>addUser(\"Mina\")</code>, qual nome recebe <code>\"Mina\"</code> dentro da função copiada?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"addUser\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"user\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" text = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Added: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(text + user);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>user</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>text</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Nenhum nome recebe o valor, pois a função não tem parâmetro.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>user</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: No value",
            "id": 74578,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Chame a função e passe um valor para ela.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"removeUser\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"user\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Removed: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + user);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"removeUser(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Lisa&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"64\" endIndex=\"74\" /><option startIndex=\"75\" endIndex=\"81\" /><option startIndex=\"82\" endIndex=\"83\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"var\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"function\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Removed: Lisa\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>removeUser</code> seguido de <code>\"Lisa\"</code> e finalmente <code>;</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Complete <code>removeUser</code> e chame a função com <code>\"Lisa\"</code> para que o console informe a remoção dela.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"removeUser\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"user\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Removed: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + user);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"removeUser(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Lisa&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"64\" endIndex=\"74\" /><option startIndex=\"75\" endIndex=\"81\" /><option startIndex=\"82\" endIndex=\"83\" /><option startIndex=\"20\" endIndex=\"24\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"let\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"var\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"return\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Removed: Lisa\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>user</code> seguido de <code>removeUser</code>, <code>\"Lisa\"</code> e finalmente <code>;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Pass parameters",
            "id": 74571,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Para que servem os parâmetros?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Os parâmetros nos ajudam a passar informações específicas para as funções</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Parâmetros facilitam a chamada de funções</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Os parâmetros nos permitem exibir variáveis no console</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Os parâmetros nos ajudam a passar informações específicas para as funções.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Uma função <code>greet</code> deve exibir um nome diferente a cada chamada. O que ela deve usar para esse nome variável?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Um parâmetro, como name.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Uma string de nome fixa dentro da função.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">A mesma string de nome em todas as chamadas da função.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Um parâmetro, como name.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: No value",
            "id": 74646,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Adicione um parâmetro à função e depois chame-a com um valor.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"temperatureUpdate\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"temp\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Current temp:&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(temp);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"temperatureUpdate(\" /><text value=\"60\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"27\" endIndex=\"31\" /><option startIndex=\"106\" endIndex=\"108\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"var\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Current temp:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"60\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>temp</code> seguido de <code>60</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Complete a função e passe o número <code>60</code> para ela exibir <code>Current temp:</code> seguido por esse número.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"temperatureUpdate\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"temp\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Current temp:&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(temp);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"temperatureUpdate(\" /><text value=\"60\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"27\" endIndex=\"31\" /><option startIndex=\"106\" endIndex=\"108\" /><option startIndex=\"9\" endIndex=\"26\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"number\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;60&quot;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"return\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Current temp:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"60\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>temperatureUpdate</code> seguido de <code>temp</code> e finalmente <code>60</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Passing a value ",
            "id": 74648,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Conclua a chamada da função.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"totalWeight\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"amount\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" measurement = \" /><text value=\"&quot; grams&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(amount + measurement);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"totalWeight(\" /><text value=\"250\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"100\" endIndex=\"111\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"250 grams\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>totalWeight</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Using the return value",
            "id": 74685,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>O que acontece quando adicionamos um valor de retorno a uma função?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">A função retorna um valor para o código que a chama</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">A função não pode mais usar declarações de exibição</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Isso significa que só poderemos chamar a função uma vez</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">A função retorna um valor para o código que a chama.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>const total = addTen(20)</code> chama uma função que retorna <code>30</code>. O que é armazenado em <code>total</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>30</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>20</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">A própria função.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>30</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: No return statement",
            "id": 74687,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Como acabamos retornando <code>undefined</code> da nossa função?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Ao esquecer de adicionar a declaração <code>return</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Ao não incluir nenhuma instrução de exibição em nosso código</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Chamando a função com um parâmetro</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Ao esquecer de adicionar a declaração <code>return</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>const answer = showAnswer()</code> chama uma função que só exibe texto e não tem <code>return</code>. O que é armazenado em <code>answer</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>undefined</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">O texto exibido.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">O nome da função como uma string.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>undefined</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Return",
            "id": 74698,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Crie uma variável <code>result</code> e armazene o resultado de chamar a função com um valor dentro dela.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"moreThanTen\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"number\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" number &gt; \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" result = moreThanTen(\" /><text value=\"14\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(result);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"54\" endIndex=\"59\" /><option startIndex=\"60\" endIndex=\"66\" /><option startIndex=\"69\" endIndex=\"80\" /><option startIndex=\"81\" endIndex=\"83\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"return\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"true\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>const</code> seguido de <code>result</code> e depois <code>moreThanTen</code>, <code>14</code>.</p></body></html>",
